 <h1 id="treehouse-project">Treehouse Project</h1>[m
 <p>A year ago I became the proud but somewhat terrified custodian of the Treehouse at Dancing Rabbit: A one-bedroom off-grid cabin held above the Missouri prairie like a Baba Yaga hut by twelve Osage posts.</p>[m
 <p>It is a beautiful--some would say ridiculous--structure, that the previous proprietor had been renting out as a three-season Bed and Breakfast, despite lacking siding, heating, insulation, or electricity.  </p>[m
