 <p>This website, for now, is to solicit feedback on the components I'm about to order. You are the crowds, and I want your wisdom. Or, to put it differently: one of the advantages of living in a cooperative ecovillage, and having smart and ecologically minded friends, is the availability of good advice, and this is my way of asking for it. </p>[m
 <p>I'm hoping to order everything in the next few days, so if you do want to email me or talk in person, please do so soon.</p>[m
